      "route_status_before_this_audit": "management_successor_unresolved",
      "changed_by_this_audit": false
    },
    {
      "source_item_id": "LEGACY-CAND-LINE-000019",
      "physical_line": 29,
      "text": "包括的な自動修復権限、実装・運用完了を成立させない。",
      "effective_classification_before_this_audit": "explanation",
      "condition_subtype_before_this_audit": null,
      "route_status_before_this_audit": "not_condition",
      "changed_by_this_audit": false
    },
    {
      "source_item_id": "LEGACY-CAND-LINE-000028",
      "physical_line": 42,
      "text": "正本化するときは、候補をこのdirectoryに残したままcurrentと二重authorityにしない。昇格先、",
      "effective_classification_before_this_audit": "condition",
      "condition_subtype_before_this_audit": "management_process_condition",
      "route_status_before_this_audit": "management_successor_unresolved",
      "changed_by_this_audit": false
    },
    {
      "source_item_id": "LEGACY-CAND-LINE-000029",
      "physical_line": 43,
      "text": "compatibility／archive移動、参照更新を同一migrationで閉じる。",
      "effective_classification_before_this_audit": "explanation",
      "condition_subtype_before_this_audit": null,
      "route_status_before_this_audit": "not_condition",
      "changed_by_this_audit": false
    },
    {
      "source_item_id": "LEGACY-CAND-LINE-000033",
      "physical_line": 50,
      "text": "この文書のINV IDとP0〜P4は、Requirement ID、障害severity、L1〜L12、Release Waveではない。",
      "effective_classification_before_this_audit": "explanation",
      "condition_subtype_before_this_audit": null,
      "route_status_before_this_audit": "not_condition",
      "changed_by_this_audit": false
    },
    {
      "source_item_id": "LEGACY-CAND-LINE-000034",
      "physical_line": 51,
      "text": "候補文書だけで72件を承認・v1必須化・一括Issue化・実装済み扱いにしない。選択したINVごとに",
      "effective_classification_before_this_audit": "condition",
      "condition_subtype_before_this_audit": "management_process_condition",
      "route_status_before_this_audit": "management_successor_unresolved",
      "changed_by_this_audit": false
    },
    {
      "source_item_id": "LEGACY-CAND-LINE-000035",
      "physical_line": 52,
      "text": "current Requirement／Capability／Issue／Release ownerを再解決し、意味・受入・権限の差分だけを",
      "effective_classification_before_this_audit": "explanation",
      "condition_subtype_before_this_audit": null,
      "route_status_before_this_audit": "not_condition",
      "changed_by_this_audit": false
    },
    {
      "source_item_id": "LEGACY-CAND-LINE-000036",
